Subject: [PATCH] The brief-inventory API: the equations the pre-ship
 inventories of U2-S, B6 F3, B6 F5 and canonizer cont6 found missing
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Simulation: bufferedCompTM's k and State (simps, isSimp := false); VirtualTag_iff.
- UniversalStartup: universalPrefixTM's k and State (simps); prefixCanonTM_eq.
- Build/VirtualInput: vhostBuffer_eq, vhostBank_eq.
- Build/CfgRecord: RecSym.digitEmb_apply, binDigits_eq, posWidth_eq.
- Build/CounterLoop: counterLoopBody's fields (simps); decFixed_nil, decFixed_true_cons,
  decFixed_false_cons.
- Build/Loop: stateWord_eq.

Declarations added only; no @[simp]; no statement or definition changes (policy §1, definitions
land with their lemmas; the user's "Everything" rule).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
